silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_concrete_anchor_6#mittensvetrecordbackendtarget silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordBackendTarget is In section 'Sous: The Under-Reading Observation Role' the bare symbol left(Hom(-,Mittens),,Hom(Mittens,-)right) anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status." .
